      "subject": "בנפשו הוא",
      "rationale": "Tazmilt-agi n taḥric maca d tidet: 'd s yiman-is i yettwaf', kra n tsuqilin qqaren-d 'd lmut-iw i d-iteddun'."
    }
  ],
